rem ACMP 158 - The Grand Combinator
rem Solved in Euler 1-15 style.
rem
rem Bender and K children of Schmidt
rem (K + 1 people) divide X rubles
rem in 5-ruble banknotes.
rem N = X // 5 banknotes.
rem Stars and bars:
rem C(N + M - 1, M - 1) = C(N + K, K).

use io
use cli
use numbers

arg X integer = 500
arg K integer = 100

Banknotes = X // 5
return Banknotes + K binomial K
